# A hazard's cue at eye level lies on the ground and hangs by the body; it never
# draws over the head (tests/camera/test_shoulder.gd
# test_no_hazard_cue_draws_over_the_body_at_eye_level). Over the shoulder in the
# sulphur jungle's fumes, in fog, the frame taken as the cough is drawn.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/cue_eye.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=fog:0.6 --view=shoulder
place typical_sulphur_jungle
wait 2.0
await cough 30
shot 01-a-cough-at-eye-level
wait 0.1
shot 02-a-moment-on
